[{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/blog_pic_without_subtitles(1).png#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/blog_pic_without_subtitles(1).png#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n"},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/document_detail/2983281.html","label":"DASHSCOPE","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/document_detail/2983281.html\" label=\"DASHSCOPE\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Qwen/Qwen3-Livetranslate-Demo","label":"HUGGING FACE DEMO","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Qwen/Qwen3-Livetranslate-Demo\" label=\"HUGGING FACE DEMO\" external=true >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"**Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash** delivers high‑precision, lightning‑fast and ultra‑reliable real‑time multilingual audio and video interpretation. With the extensive capabilities of Qwen3‑Omni and training on millions of hours of multimodal data, it enables both offline and live translation in 18 languages, making cross‑language communication seamless. ","text":"**Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash** delivers high‑precision, lightning‑fast and ultra‑reliable real‑time multilingual audio and video interpretation. With the extensive capabilities of Qwen3‑Omni and training on millions of hours of multimodal data, it enables both offline and live translation in 18 languages, making cross‑language communication seamless. ","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash**","text":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash","text":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" delivers high‑precision, lightning‑fast and ultra‑reliable real‑time multilingual audio and video interpretation. With the extensive capabilities of Qwen3‑Omni and training on millions of hours of multimodal data, it enables both offline and live translation in 18 languages, making cross‑language communication seamless. ","text":" delivers high‑precision, lightning‑fast and ultra‑reliable real‑time multilingual audio and video interpretation. With the extensive capabilities of Qwen3‑Omni and training on millions of hours of multimodal data, it enables both offline and live translation in 18 languages, making cross‑language communication seamless. ","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Key Features:","text":"Key Features:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Key Features:","text":"Key Features:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"* **Multilingual and Dialect Coverage**: Supports major official languages including Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Indonesian, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Hindi, Greek, Turkish; as well as dialect and accent translation for Mandarin, Cantonese, Beijing, Wu, Sichuan, and Tianjin dialects.\n\n* **Vision‑Enhanced Comprehension**: For the first time, Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash incorporates visual context augmentation, enabling it to not only understand what it hears but also understand what it sees. By detecting and interpreting lip movements, gestures, on‑screen text, and real‑world entities, the system robustly handles noisy audio environments and resolves ambiguities in terms with multiple meanings.\n\n* **3s Latency**: A lightweight mixture‑of‑experts architecture, coupled with dynamic sampling, enables simultaneous interpretation with latency as low as three seconds.\n\n* **Lossless Interpretation**: Utilizes semantic unit prediction to mitigate cross‑lingual reordering challenges in translation, achieving real‑time translation quality that is close to offline translation.\n\n* **Natural Voice Quality**: With training on massive speech datasets, the model delivers lifelike voices whose tone and expressiveness naturally follow the meaning of the source speech.","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":true,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Multilingual and Dialect Coverage**: Supports major official languages including Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Indonesian, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Hindi, Greek, Turkish; as well as dialect and accent translation for Mandarin, Cantonese, Beijing, Wu, Sichuan, and Tianjin dialects.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Multilingual and Dialect Coverage**: Supports major official languages including Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Indonesian, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Hindi, Greek, Turkish; as well as dialect and accent translation for Mandarin, Cantonese, Beijing, Wu, Sichuan, and Tianjin dialects.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Multilingual and Dialect Coverage**: Supports major official languages including Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Indonesian, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Hindi, Greek, Turkish; as well as dialect and accent translation for Mandarin, Cantonese, Beijing, Wu, Sichuan, and Tianjin dialects.\n","text":"**Multilingual and Dialect Coverage**: Supports major official languages including Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Indonesian, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Hindi, Greek, Turkish; as well as dialect and accent translation for Mandarin, Cantonese, Beijing, Wu, Sichuan, and Tianjin dialects.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Multilingual and Dialect Coverage**","text":"Multilingual and Dialect Coverage","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Multilingual and Dialect Coverage","text":"Multilingual and Dialect Coverage","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Supports major official languages including Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Indonesian, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Hindi, Greek, Turkish; as well as dialect and accent translation for Mandarin, Cantonese, Beijing, Wu, Sichuan, and Tianjin dialects.","text":": Supports major official languages including Chinese, English, French, German, Russian, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Japanese, Korean, Indonesian, Thai, Vietnamese, Arabic, Hindi, Greek, Turkish; as well as dialect and accent translation for Mandarin, Cantonese, Beijing, Wu, Sichuan, and Tianjin dialects.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Vision‑Enhanced Comprehension**: For the first time, Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash incorporates visual context augmentation, enabling it to not only understand what it hears but also understand what it sees. By detecting and interpreting lip movements, gestures, on‑screen text, and real‑world entities, the system robustly handles noisy audio environments and resolves ambiguities in terms with multiple meanings.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Vision‑Enhanced Comprehension**: For the first time, Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash incorporates visual context augmentation, enabling it to not only understand what it hears but also understand what it sees. By detecting and interpreting lip movements, gestures, on‑screen text, and real‑world entities, the system robustly handles noisy audio environments and resolves ambiguities in terms with multiple meanings.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Vision‑Enhanced Comprehension**: For the first time, Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash incorporates visual context augmentation, enabling it to not only understand what it hears but also understand what it sees. By detecting and interpreting lip movements, gestures, on‑screen text, and real‑world entities, the system robustly handles noisy audio environments and resolves ambiguities in terms with multiple meanings.\n","text":"**Vision‑Enhanced Comprehension**: For the first time, Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash incorporates visual context augmentation, enabling it to not only understand what it hears but also understand what it sees. By detecting and interpreting lip movements, gestures, on‑screen text, and real‑world entities, the system robustly handles noisy audio environments and resolves ambiguities in terms with multiple meanings.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Vision‑Enhanced Comprehension**","text":"Vision‑Enhanced Comprehension","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Vision‑Enhanced Comprehension","text":"Vision‑Enhanced Comprehension","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": For the first time, Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash incorporates visual context augmentation, enabling it to not only understand what it hears but also understand what it sees. By detecting and interpreting lip movements, gestures, on‑screen text, and real‑world entities, the system robustly handles noisy audio environments and resolves ambiguities in terms with multiple meanings.","text":": For the first time, Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash incorporates visual context augmentation, enabling it to not only understand what it hears but also understand what it sees. By detecting and interpreting lip movements, gestures, on‑screen text, and real‑world entities, the system robustly handles noisy audio environments and resolves ambiguities in terms with multiple meanings.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **3s Latency**: A lightweight mixture‑of‑experts architecture, coupled with dynamic sampling, enables simultaneous interpretation with latency as low as three seconds.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**3s Latency**: A lightweight mixture‑of‑experts architecture, coupled with dynamic sampling, enables simultaneous interpretation with latency as low as three seconds.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**3s Latency**: A lightweight mixture‑of‑experts architecture, coupled with dynamic sampling, enables simultaneous interpretation with latency as low as three seconds.\n","text":"**3s Latency**: A lightweight mixture‑of‑experts architecture, coupled with dynamic sampling, enables simultaneous interpretation with latency as low as three seconds.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**3s Latency**","text":"3s Latency","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"3s Latency","text":"3s Latency","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": A lightweight mixture‑of‑experts architecture, coupled with dynamic sampling, enables simultaneous interpretation with latency as low as three seconds.","text":": A lightweight mixture‑of‑experts architecture, coupled with dynamic sampling, enables simultaneous interpretation with latency as low as three seconds.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Lossless Interpretation**: Utilizes semantic unit prediction to mitigate cross‑lingual reordering challenges in translation, achieving real‑time translation quality that is close to offline translation.\n\n","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Lossless Interpretation**: Utilizes semantic unit prediction to mitigate cross‑lingual reordering challenges in translation, achieving real‑time translation quality that is close to offline translation.\n","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Lossless Interpretation**: Utilizes semantic unit prediction to mitigate cross‑lingual reordering challenges in translation, achieving real‑time translation quality that is close to offline translation.\n","text":"**Lossless Interpretation**: Utilizes semantic unit prediction to mitigate cross‑lingual reordering challenges in translation, achieving real‑time translation quality that is close to offline translation.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Lossless Interpretation**","text":"Lossless Interpretation","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Lossless Interpretation","text":"Lossless Interpretation","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": Utilizes semantic unit prediction to mitigate cross‑lingual reordering challenges in translation, achieving real‑time translation quality that is close to offline translation.","text":": Utilizes semantic unit prediction to mitigate cross‑lingual reordering challenges in translation, achieving real‑time translation quality that is close to offline translation.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"* **Natural Voice Quality**: With training on massive speech datasets, the model delivers lifelike voices whose tone and expressiveness naturally follow the meaning of the source speech.","task":false,"loose":true,"text":"**Natural Voice Quality**: With training on massive speech datasets, the model delivers lifelike voices whose tone and expressiveness naturally follow the meaning of the source speech.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Natural Voice Quality**: With training on massive speech datasets, the model delivers lifelike voices whose tone and expressiveness naturally follow the meaning of the source speech.","text":"**Natural Voice Quality**: With training on massive speech datasets, the model delivers lifelike voices whose tone and expressiveness naturally follow the meaning of the source speech.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Natural Voice Quality**","text":"Natural Voice Quality","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Natural Voice Quality","text":"Natural Voice Quality","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": With training on massive speech datasets, the model delivers lifelike voices whose tone and expressiveness naturally follow the meaning of the source speech.","text":": With training on massive speech datasets, the model delivers lifelike voices whose tone and expressiveness naturally follow the meaning of the source speech.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Performance\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Performance","text":"Performance","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash achieves significantly higher accuracy than strong large-scale models, including Gemini‑2.5‑Flash, GPT‑4o‑Audio‑Preview, and Voxtral Small‑24B, on public benchmarks for Chinese, English and multilingual speech translation.","text":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash achieves significantly higher accuracy than strong large-scale models, including Gemini‑2.5‑Flash, GPT‑4o‑Audio‑Preview, and Voxtral Small‑24B, on public benchmarks for Chinese, English and multilingual speech translation.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash achieves significantly higher accuracy than strong large-scale models, including Gemini‑2.5‑Flash, GPT‑4o‑Audio‑Preview, and Voxtral Small‑24B, on public benchmarks for Chinese, English and multilingual speech translation.","text":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash achieves significantly higher accuracy than strong large-scale models, including Gemini‑2.5‑Flash, GPT‑4o‑Audio‑Preview, and Voxtral Small‑24B, on public benchmarks for Chinese, English and multilingual speech translation.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/Qwen-S2T-Flash.001.jpeg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/Qwen-S2T-Flash.001.jpeg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash consistently delivers leading translation performance across different domains and under challenging acoustic conditions.","text":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash consistently delivers leading translation performance across different domains and under challenging acoustic conditions.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash consistently delivers leading translation performance across different domains and under challenging acoustic conditions.","text":"Qwen3‑LiveTranslate‑Flash consistently delivers leading translation performance across different domains and under challenging acoustic conditions.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/Qwen-S2T-Flash.002.jpeg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/Qwen-S2T-Flash.002.jpeg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Semantic unit prediction technology alleviates cross-lingual reordering issues, enabling real-time simultaneous interpretation to significantly reduce latency while maintaining over 94% of the accuracy achieved by non-real-time translation.","text":"Semantic unit prediction technology alleviates cross-lingual reordering issues, enabling real-time simultaneous interpretation to significantly reduce latency while maintaining over 94% of the accuracy achieved by non-real-time translation.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Semantic unit prediction technology alleviates cross-lingual reordering issues, enabling real-time simultaneous interpretation to significantly reduce latency while maintaining over 94% of the accuracy achieved by non-real-time translation.","text":"Semantic unit prediction technology alleviates cross-lingual reordering issues, enabling real-time simultaneous interpretation to significantly reduce latency while maintaining over 94% of the accuracy achieved by non-real-time translation.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Visual enhancement technology further improves Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash’s translation precision in challenging scenarios such as noisy audio, ambiguous word meanings, and proper noun translation. In real-time settings, visual information compensates for missing speech context, making its advantages even more pronounced.","text":"Visual enhancement technology further improves Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash’s translation precision in challenging scenarios such as noisy audio, ambiguous word meanings, and proper noun translation. In real-time settings, visual information compensates for missing speech context, making its advantages even more pronounced.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Visual enhancement technology further improves Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash’s translation precision in challenging scenarios such as noisy audio, ambiguous word meanings, and proper noun translation. In real-time settings, visual information compensates for missing speech context, making its advantages even more pronounced.","text":"Visual enhancement technology further improves Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash’s translation precision in challenging scenarios such as noisy audio, ambiguous word meanings, and proper noun translation. In real-time settings, visual information compensates for missing speech context, making its advantages even more pronounced.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/Qwen-S2T-Flash.003.jpeg#center","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/Qwen-S2T-Flash.003.jpeg#center\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n\n","pre":false,"text":" <!-- 2742 × 2499 -->\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Examples\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Examples","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Examples","text":"Examples","escaped":false}]},{"type":"heading","raw":"#### **Speech‑to‑Speech Simultaneous Translation**\n\n","depth":4,"text":"**Speech‑to‑Speech Simultaneous Translation**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Speech‑to‑Speech Simultaneous Translation**","text":"Speech‑to‑Speech Simultaneous Translation","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Speech‑to‑Speech Simultaneous Translation","text":"Speech‑to‑Speech Simultaneous Translation","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li>Local API Test: real‑time interpretation | English → Chinese<ul><li><em>Audio Source:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.alibabagroup.com/ir-financial-reports-quarterly-results\">Alibaba 2023 Q4 (December) Earnings Conference Call</a></em></li><li>Input Audio:*<br><audio controls=\"\"><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/caibaohui_audio.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">Your browser does not support the audio tag.</audio></li></ul></li></ul>\n\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text);\"><li>Local API Test: real‑time interpretation | English → Chinese<ul><li><em>Audio Source:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.alibabagroup.com/ir-financial-reports-quarterly-results\">Alibaba 2023 Q4 (December) Earnings Conference Call</a></em></li><li>Input Audio:*<br><audio controls=\"\"><source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/caibaohui_audio.wav\" type=\"audio/wav\">Your browser does not support the audio tag.</audio></li></ul></li></ul>\n\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<video width=\"100%\" controls>\n  <source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/livetrans_audio.mov\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n  Your browser does not support the video tag.\n</video>\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<video width=\"100%\" controls>\n  <source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/livetrans_audio.mov\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n  Your browser does not support the video tag.\n</video>\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"#### **Vision‑Enhanced Speech Translation**\n\n","depth":4,"text":"**Vision‑Enhanced Speech Translation**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Vision‑Enhanced Speech Translation**","text":"Vision‑Enhanced Speech Translation","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Vision‑Enhanced Speech Translation","text":"Vision‑Enhanced Speech Translation","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list","raw":"* Example 1 – Homophones / Ambiguous Terms | English → Chinese","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"* Example 1 – Homophones / Ambiguous Terms | English → Chinese","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Example 1 – Homophones / Ambiguous Terms | English → Chinese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Example 1 – Homophones / Ambiguous Terms | English → Chinese","text":"Example 1 – Homophones / Ambiguous Terms | English → Chinese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Example 1 – Homophones / Ambiguous Terms | English → Chinese","text":"Example 1 – Homophones / Ambiguous Terms | English → Chinese","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<video width=\"100%\" controls >\n  <source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/mask_linhuan_high.mov\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n  Your browser does not support the video tag.\n</video>\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<video width=\"100%\" controls >\n  <source src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-LiveTranslate-Flash/mask_linhuan_high.mov\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n  Your browser does not support the video tag.\n</video>\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text); margin-top:-30px;\"><li><p>English Audio Input: What is <span style=\"color:red\">mask</span>? This is <span style=\"color:red\">mask</span>. This is <span style=\"color:red\">mask</span>. This is <span style=\"color:red\">mask</span>. This is <span style=\"color:red\">Musk</span>.</p></li><li><p>Audio Only Output: 什么是口罩？这是<span style=\"color:green\">口罩</span>，这是<span style=\"color:green\">口罩</span>，这是<span style=\"color:green\">口罩</span>，这是<span style=\"color:green\">口罩</span>。</p></li><li><p>Vision Enhanced Output: 什么是口罩？这是<span style=\"color:red\">面膜</span>，这是<span style=\"color:red\">口罩</span>，这是<span style=\"color:red\">面具</span>，这是<span style=\"color:red\">马斯克</span>。</p></li></ul>\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<ul style=\"color: var(--character-primary-text); margin-top:-30px;\"><li><p>English Audio Input: What is <span style=\"color:red\">mask</span>? This is <span style=\"color:red\">mask</span>. This is <span style=\"color:red\">mask</span>. This is <span style=\"color:red\">mask</span>. This is <span style=\"color:red\">Musk</span>.</p></li><li><p>Audio Only Output: 什么是口罩？这是<span style=\"color:green\">口罩</span>，这是<span style=\"color:green\">口罩</span>，这是<span style=\"color:green\">口罩</span>，这是<span style=\"color:green\">口罩</span>。</p></li><li><p>Vision Enhanced Output: 什么是口罩？这是<span style=\"color:red\">面膜</span>，这是<span style=\"color:red\">口罩</span>，这是<span style=\"color:red\">面具</span>，这是<span style=\"color:red\">马斯克</span>。</p></li></ul>\n\n"},{"type":"html","block":true,"raw":"<br>\n\n","pre":false,"text":"<br>\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"* Example 2 – Low‑Frequency Proper Noun Recognition (Person Names) | Thai → Chinese","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"* Example 2 – Low‑Frequency Proper Noun Recognition (Person Names) | Thai → Chinese","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Example 2 – Low‑Frequency Proper Noun Recognition (Person Names) | Thai → Chinese","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Example 2 – Low‑F